; $CDDD - Check and execute the command token of the Z-80 (CMDTOK)
; CSAVE, CLOAD, MERGE, CHAIN and LLIST (list at $CE3B) need MODE 1 and, if the
; program is in S1 / S2 (TITLE), a slot whose descriptor page has b7 set at 07H;
; in MODE 1 the sub-CPU is also asked (command 5CH).  Any other token runs.
;
;   Entry parameters: A = low byte of the saved S-Reg, CMDTOK = token
; Modified registers: All registers
;   Error conditions: C and A = 2: refused, UH = 6EH (MODE 0) or 18H (slot /
;                     sub-CPU)
